# ---- AFN 忽略规则 ----
# 依据：SPEC-02 §7 数据分类与可见度、§8 密钥管理

# ==== 密钥与本地配置（严禁入库）====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets.*
credentials.*

# ==== 真实个人数据（架构书六(一)「中」敏感级，不得入库）====
# 仅保留 *.example.md / *.example.json 脱敏样例
*.private.md
*.private.json
*.private.yaml
*.private.yml
knowledge/personal/*
!knowledge/personal/README.md
!knowledge/personal/*.example.md
!knowledge/personal/*.example.json
!knowledge/personal/.gitkeep

# ==== Python ====
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ==== Node（仅用于 commitlint 等工具链，不构建产物）====
node_modules/
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock

# ==== 运行产物与日志 ====
logs/
*.log
.afn-cache/
.cache/

# ==== 操作系统与编辑器 ====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json.example
!.vscode/extensions.json.example
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ==== 临时文件 ====
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
tmp/
temp/
